---
/**
 * Step 3-UX-7a — distractor 검수 페이지 (mock).
 *
 * 5지선다 오답 후보 BATCH 보강 진산 검수 워크플로우 UI.
 * mock seed 표시 — 실 API fetch는 Step 3-UX-7c chunk에서 도입.
 *
 * 근거: docs/plans/phase3-learning-ux-modes.plan.md §6.3 + §13 D1 + Step 3-UX-7.
 */

import { DistractorQueue } from '../../components/DistractorQueue';
import { MOCK_DISTRACTOR_ITEMS } from '../../types/distractor';
---

<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>ThePick Admin — Distractors</title>
    <style>
      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      body {
        font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
        background: #f1f5f9;
        color: #0f172a;
      }
      .nav {
        background: #0f172a;
        color: #f8fafc;
        padding: 12px 24px;
        display: flex;
        gap: 16px;
        align-items: center;
      }
      .nav h1 {
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .nav a {
        color: #cbd5e1;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 13px;
      }
      .nav a:hover {
        color: #fff;
      }
      .nav .spacer {
        flex: 1;
      }
      .nav .badge {
        font-size: 11px;
        background: #475569;
        padding: 2px 8px;
        border-radius: 4px;
      }
      .container {
        padding: 16px;
        max-width: 1400px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }
      .container > header {
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }
      .container > header h2 {
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #0f172a;
      }
      .container > header p {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #64748b;
        margin-top: 4px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="nav">
      <h1>ThePick Admin</h1>
      <a href="/">Graph</a>
      <a href="/telemetry">Telemetry</a>
      <a href="/distractors">Distractors</a>
      <span class="spacer"></span>
      <span class="badge">Step 3-UX-7a mock</span>
    </div>
    <div class="container">
      <header>
        <h2>객관식 오답 후보 (distractor) 검수</h2>
        <p>
          기출 원문 5지선다 BATCH 추출 결과를 진산 검수 후 승인합니다. 신뢰도 낮은 항목부터 우선
          검수하세요. (mock 데이터 — Step 3-UX-7c에서 실 API 연동 예정)
        </p>
      </header>
      <DistractorQueue items={MOCK_DISTRACTOR_ITEMS} client:only="react" />
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
